    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern interpretation of the old &quot;steady hand&quot;/wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand steady whilst moving a ring along a wire! Dodge obstacles, be as quick as you can, and don't touch the wire too much or you'll explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FUR\u014c is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and has many features planned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features available in <strong>Early Access</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of levels</strong>, in a variety of bizarre environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock stars which can be spent on, well, more levels!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned feature additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer (Online)</strong>: Compete with other players to complete levels in the quickest time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong>: Create levels and share them with others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildcards</strong>: Think of these like a variety of &quot;weapon mods&quot;. Slow down time to traverse fast moving &quot;platforms&quot; easier, teleport from one part of the level to another, regenerate health, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern interpretation of the old &quot;steady hand&quot;/wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your hand steady whilst moving a ring along a wire! Dodge obstacles, be as quick as you can, and don't touch the wire too much or you'll explode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FUR\u014c is currently in <strong>Early Access</strong>, and has many features planned!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features available in <strong>Early Access</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loads of levels</strong>, in a variety of bizarre environments!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete <strong>levels</strong> and <strong>challenges</strong> to unlock stars which can be spent on, well, more levels!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Planned feature additions:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer (Online)</strong>: Compete with other players to complete levels in the quickest time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor</strong>: Create levels and share them with others!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wildcards</strong>: Think of these like a variety of &quot;weapon mods&quot;. Slow down time to traverse fast moving &quot;platforms&quot; easier, teleport from one part of the level to another, regenerate health, and more!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A modern interpretation of the old wire buzzer game from the 60's in VR! Keep a steady hand and maintain your flow!",
